        },
        "description": {
          "en-US": "LastWave is a next-generation YouTube Music client with an algorithmic smart playlist generator, real-time synced lyrics and a universal Last.fm scrobbler for Android.\n\nFeatures:\n- Stream from YouTube Music with an ad-free experience\n- Smart Playlist Generator that builds mixes from your listening habits\n- Real-time synchronized lyrics with word-level timing\n- Universal Last.fm scrobbling\n- Offline downloads and caching for playback without a connection\n- Background playback with full notification controls\n- Audio effects: equalizer, bass boost, tempo and pitch control\n- Sleep timer and gapless playback\n- Material You dynamic theming\n- Light, Dark and AMOLED themes\n- Import playlists and library from other clients\n\nLastWave is not affiliated with YouTube or Google."
        },
