        "name": {
          "en-US": "Metrolist"
        },
        "authorName": "Metrolist",
        "summary": {
          "en-US": "Material 3 YouTube Music client for Android"
        },
        "description": {
          "en-US": "Metrolist is a Material 3 YouTube Music client for Android.\n\nFeatures:\n- Play any song or video from YouTube Music\n- Background playback\n- Personalized quick picks\n- Library management\n- Download and cache songs for offline playback\n- Search for songs, albums, artists, videos and playlists\n- Live lyrics\n- YouTube Music account login support\n- Syncing of songs, artists, albums and playlists, to and from your account\n- Skip silence\n- Import playlists\n- Audio normalization\n- Adjust tempo and pitch\n- Local playlist management\n- Reorder songs in a playlist or the queue\n- Light, Dark, black and Dynamic themes\n- Sleep timer\n- Full Material 3 design\n\nMetrolist is not affiliated with YouTube or Google."
        },
